      ],
      "text": "Custom interceptors can filter targets via interceptClass(className, byteCode) and interceptMethod(ClassNode, MethodNode) hooks, and implement lifecycle callbacks including doOnStart, doOnFinish, doOnThrowableThrown, and doOnThrowableUncatched, each receiving the Method, relevant payload, and an executionId."
    },
